The DSP of some of Hermann Meyer's (brummer10) GxPlugins, and of two
Guitarix effects, used by Ikaros Studio's pedals. GxPlugins are GPL 3 (each
pedal's folder keeps its repository's LICENSE); Guitarix is GPL 2 or later
(guitarix/COPYING).

Only the Faust-generated DSP is kept (dsp/*.cc, the tables they include and
the gx_pluginlv2.h they need). The LV2 wrappers (plugin/), GUIs (gui/) and
the bundled zita-resampler are not used. ikaros/ is ours: one small file per
pedal that compiles its DSP portably (see ikaros/GxDsp.h), and the CMake
build.

